A '''Bread Bowl''' is a {{Special}} item.

== Obtaining ==
A '''Bread Bowl''' can be purchased from {{NPCSprite|Feast Baker Scott}} for {{Kernels|10000}}.

== Usage ==
A '''Bread Bowl''' can be given to another player. Upon doing so, the '''Bread Bowl''' is consumed and the receiving player receives a {{Item|Gifted Bread Bowl}}.

Upon gifting a '''Bread Bowl''', the following message is displayed:
{{Dialogue|
&6&l---------------------------------------
&7<player> &6&lRECEIVED A BREAD BOWL FROM &7<player>

&6&lGG!
&6&l---------------------------------------
}}

